    "updated_at": "2026-08-17T08:57:02Z",
    "body": "IIRC there was a pattern of `<object><embed>` for Flash (or Java?) where the `object` would be used by IE and the `embed` by other browsers, and used the same `name` for both but expected property lookup to only return a single element.\n\nSince plugins are no longer supported except for PDF, the complexity may no longer be needed for web compat. If Gecko gets away with ignoring this we can probably drop it.",
